      {
        "t": "metaValue",
        "html": "AutoMatic Network is a dex aggregator built on Polygon chain. It serves as a decentralized platform for stakers and farmers to have their assets in one place rather than in different apps, removing the hurdle of having to monitor many crypto assets and investments across various dexes and giving users control in one interface. I worked on this project as a contract with a team of three; a voiceover artist, a 3D video editor and I, the animation director and storyboard curator.",
